<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>100% Quality Guarantee - WuzWear Industry</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/whyus.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
 <%- include('partials/nav') %>

    <header class="tx-hero-banner">
        <img src="../photos/garments-carepolicy.webp" alt="Garment Manufacturing Process" class="tx-hero-img-fill">
        <div class="tx-hero-gradient-overlay"></div>
        <div class="tx-hero-scroll-prompt" id="txScrollTrigger">
            <span class="tx-mouse-wheel"></span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="fp-process-section" id="fpProcessSection">
        <div class="fp-container">
            <div class="fp-header-block">
                <h2 class="fp-main-title">Our Process</h2>
                <h3 class="fp-sub-title">What happens after you place your order?</h3>
                <p class="fp-intro-text">
                    At WuzWear Industry, we work closely with you to bring your customized clothing line to life exactly the way you envision it. To ensure the best results, we require your cooperation in finalizing the key details of your project. Once everything is confirmed, our expert team begins production with precision, care, and attention to quality.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="fp-steps-grid">
                <div class="fp-step-item">
                    <div class="fp-badge-container">
                        <div class="fp-step-number">1</div>
                        <div class="fp-step-tag">Documenting Your Requirements</div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Order Summary</h4>
                    <p class="fp-step-desc">
                        At WuzWear Industry, we carefully document every instruction and artwork you share, creating a detailed order summary. This process usually takes one to two business days, depending on clarity of information. If details are missing or unclear, additional time may be required to ensure accuracy before moving to the next step.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="fp-step-item">
                    <div class="fp-badge-container">
                        <div class="fp-step-number">2</div>
                        <div class="fp-step-tag">Finalizing Your Order Details</div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="fp-step-heading">Approval</h4>
                    <p class="fp-step-desc">
                        Once the order summary is ready, we share it with you by phone or email for review. Our apparel consultant will guide you through requested changes and finalize adjustments. After you approve the summary, the official turnaround time begins, allowing us to confidently proceed with the sampling process.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="qg-guarantee-section">
        <div class="qg-container">
            <div class="qg-header-block">
                <h2 class="qg-main-title">100% Quality Guarantee WuzWear Industry</h2>
                <span class="qg-label-tag">Strict Quality Protocols for Every Order</span>
                <p class="qg-desc-paragraph">
                    Ordering your inventory from WuzWear Industry comes with exclusive privileges, including our promise of a <strong>100% Quality Guarantee</strong> on every apparel or accessory you order.
                </p>
                <p class="qg-desc-paragraph">
                    We ensure complete accuracy in production, so if you order 100 pieces, you will receive 100 flawless items exactly as described, ready for retail without defects. This policy reflects our commitment to precision, reliability, and excellence.
                </p>
                <p class="qg-desc-paragraph">
                    Since we work with you in creating apparel from scratch, WuzWear Industry provides full quality assurance on every detail we promise. When you place a custom order with us, you can feel confident and at ease knowing your garments will meet the highest standards of craftsmanship.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="qg-matrix-grid">
                <div class="qg-matrix-card">
                    <div class="qg-circle-frame">
                        <div class="qg-img-inner qg-img-placeholder " style="background-color: #2e4436; background-image: url(/photos/garantee1.webp); "></div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="qg-card-title">Onsite Quality Assurance</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="qg-matrix-card">
                    <div class="qg-circle-frame">
                        <div class="qg-img-inner qg-img-placeholder" style="background-color: #613131; background-image: url(/photos/garantee2.webp); "></div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="qg-card-title">No Loose Threads</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="qg-matrix-card">
                    <div class="qg-circle-frame">
                        <div class="qg-img-inner qg-img-placeholder" style="background-color: #4a4d52; background-image: url(/photos/garantee3.webp); "></div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="qg-card-title">No Stitching Errors</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="qg-matrix-card">
                    <div class="qg-circle-frame">
                        <div class="qg-img-inner qg-img-placeholder" style="background-color: #695e3d; background-image: url(/photos/garantee4.webp); "></div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="qg-card-title">No Stains</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="qg-matrix-card">
                    <div class="qg-circle-frame">
                        <div class="qg-img-inner qg-img-placeholder" style="background-color: #1f3d52; background-image: url(/photos/garantee5.webp); "></div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="qg-card-title">100% Preshrunk</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="qg-matrix-card">
                    <div class="qg-circle-frame">
                        <div class="qg-img-inner qg-img-placeholder" style="background-color: #421e1e; background-image: url(/photos/garantee6.webp); "></div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="qg-card-title">No Print Mistakes</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="qg-matrix-card">
                    <div class="qg-circle-frame">
                        <div class="qg-img-inner qg-img-placeholder" style="background-color: #2b3947; background-image: url(/photos/garantee7.webp); "></div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="qg-card-title">According to Sizes Provided <span class="qg-span-sub">(With 1 Inch tolerance)</span></h4>
                </div>
                <div class="qg-matrix-card">
                    <div class="qg-circle-frame">
                        <div class="qg-img-inner qg-img-placeholder" style="background-color: #594141; background-image: url(/photos/garantee8.webp); "></div>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="qg-card-title">Quality Packing</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

<%- include('partials/popup') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
     


    <script src="../js/100-quality-guarantee.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
